  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="44">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 44</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="44" corresp="#wit-d-incomplete">And þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> hi Sunnandæges cypinga ⁊ folciscra gemota georne geswican.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="44" corresp="#wit-k">⁊ þæt hy Sunnandaga cypinga ⁊ folciscra gemota georne geswican.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">And þæt hy Sunnandaga cypinga and folciscra gemota georne geswican.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k">And that they should diligently abstain from marketings and public assemblies on Sundays.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">And that on Sundays markets and public meetings are to be assiduously avoided.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und dass sie willig ablassen von Sonntagskäufen und -versammlungen des Volkes [zum Gericht].</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And that they eagerly give up Sunday trading and public assemblies [for justice].</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="259"><ref target="clause:VIAtr_22-1">VI Atr 22.1</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">ebd. 22, 1</note>
      </div>
    </body>
